# Tells Git how to handle certain kinds of files.

# Never change line endings in CSV files. The Biomek software reads and writes
# these files, so they must stay byte-for-byte as they were saved.
*.csv -text

# Never change line endings in PDF files. A PDF's cross-reference table gives each object's byte
# offset, so changing a line ending would move them all (src/shared/pdf/pdf.md).
*.pdf -text
